{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"平\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y更好，整块大字保留了人物、处境和因果关系，单看大字也能较清楚地串起每屏；small：Y更好，感受与音乐旁注分开，补充较精炼，也更容易对应当屏内容；core：平，两版都完整呈现了不愿再受委屈与怀念旧日亲近、归属之间的反复拉扯，结尾也都落在带着想念继续生活。concise：X更好，Y在S07等处把连续的疑问拆成多块，先泛问再具体追问，铺陈稍显重复；human：X更好，Y的“把眼下过稳些”“怕独自扛难事”搭配不够自然，X的“把眼下日子过稳些”“独自扛事”更符合日常表达。fine：Y更好，感受更多落在观众的身体和心理体验上，X有不少内容转成了对和弦、节奏、旋律的描述；load：X更好，Y在22—31秒的短屏里累积五块较长的大字，最后留给观众整体扫读的时间偏紧，X只需抓住较短的高亮词组。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bdf7ef47-b85b-4e77-b2fe-0426b7534608", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T200424471109Z", "elapsed_seconds": 340.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:10:05.013760+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "debd4cf2078a652f30cd564d6451f04b7b628f0fdb277647076a8af315e75b3d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb5